**Audit verdict.** Theorem 4.1 checks out, but it is a modest no-go for an ansatz we chose. Its supersymmetric part is a corollary of a bosonic result the workspace had already proved, plus a standard reduction. It refutes no precise published conjecture, and it does not show that the systems are non-integrable in any wider sense. This was a read-only audit: nothing was rerun, no model was called, no files were written.

